      keyPoints: [r`$\sigma(\sigma+1)\hbar^2$ with $\sigma=0,1,2$`, r`the top state is annihilated by the raising terms`, r`$\sigma=0$ needs $S_+\psi=0$ and $S_z\psi=0$`, r`one singlet in $1\otimes1$`],
